{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Lord, speak over [G/B]our [C]lives
[G/B]Turn darkness into [Em]light [D]
[C]Separate the waters
[G/B]Form Your sons and [Em]daughters
Breathe in us Your [D]life
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Lord, speak over [G/B]our [C]lives
[G/B]Your glory multi[Em]plied [D]
[C]Call Your image bearers
[G/B]To be image [Em]bearers
God, release Your holy [D]fire
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
When You [C]speak, [Em]chaos is or[D]dered
[C]All creation [G/B]bows to its [D]knees
When You [C]speak, [Em]demons, they [D]shudder
[C]Evil has no[G/B]where to [D]flee
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Tag 1}
[C]Even when [G/B]we are [D]weak
You [G]speak
{end_of_verse}

